      "updated": 1792941703675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Privacy rule  ·  all detection runs on the phone (Rust + Kotlin), never in JS or on the server.\nThe server only sees ciphertext, tokens and coarse status. Friends get location keys only after an\nunanswered check-in, a grab or an SOS.",
      "originalText": "Privacy rule  ·  all detection runs on the phone (Rust + Kotlin), never in JS or on the server.\nThe server only sees ciphertext, tokens and coarse status. Friends get location keys only after an\nunanswered check-in, a grab or an SOS.",
